B.aq0=new A.lw("Hypertensive Emergency flowchart + Antihypertensive Drugs tables. Research add-ons draw on the AAP Clinical Practice Guideline for Screening and Management of High Blood Pressure in Children and Adolescents (2017) and the ESH 2022 paediatric hypertension consensus. For use by qualified clinicians only.",null)
